{1}{Before you is a replica of the skull of Bellerogrim, the last of the Great Dragons.  The body of Bellerogrim was discovered by Sir Walter Ginsberg in 1756.  The lair, which houses the complete skeleton, is an open exhibit and can be visited here.  [A small map shows where it is.]}{ Before you is a replica of the skull of Bellerogrim, the last of the Great Dragons.  The body of Bellerogrim was discovered by Sir Walter Ginsberg in 1756.  The lair, which houses the complete skeleton, is an open exhibit and can be visited here.  [A small map shows where it is.]}{}{}{}{}
